 could affect instability and violent conflict, they are not sufficiently specific to include in the PPS. Please submit your suggestions below. Keep them short, but feel free to explain the importance of the conflicts you sug","display_url":"docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAI…","end":174,"expanded_url":"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe8paZE9jFalJbekouZaqj3fC9CfPaSScbn04y84Mj_dgqEdw/viewform","images":[{"height":630,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110475997648760834/t3iGO37n?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110475997648760834/t3iGO37n?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":151,"status":200,"title":"What to Worry About in 2027","unwound_url":"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe8paZE9jFalJbekouZaqj3fC9CfPaSScbn04y84Mj_dgqEdw/viewform","url":"https://t.co/kxxpI1a3B7"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/9mVaHoruy8","end":198,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/CFR_org/status/2110475993542459771/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110475989230751744","start":175,"url":"https://t.co/9mVaHoruy8"}]},"id":"2110475993542459771","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1279,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"We want to hear from you: What emerging or escalating conflicts should CFR include in its 2027 risk assessment? \n\nPlease submit your suggestions here: https://t.co/kxxpI1a3B7 https://t.co/9mVaHoruy8","url":"https://x.com/CFR_org/status/2110475993542459771"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110475806468108288"]},"author_id":"272019676","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:00:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110475907039121853"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":80,"id":"936199099","start":69,"username":"AkunnaCook"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/N736YPyFzZ","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/CSIS/status/2110475907039121853/video/1","media_key":"13_2110475806468108288","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/N736YPyFzZ"}]},"id":"2110475907039121853","public_metrics"